{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"cache-solo-r2--glm53f","runHash":"afbca5b4","audio":"../../audio/narration/cache-solo-r2--glm53f.7f979f4f.mp3","audioBytes":207624,"durationMs":69091,"runEndMs":44383,"timeMap":[[0,0],[17159,17159],[21054,17159],[28679,24784],[38783,24784],[39133,24796],[39833,24796],[41991,26954],[44120,43983],[44520,44383],[69091,44383]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":7457,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM_b","text":"Hello and welcome. A single GLM 5.3 Flash agent this time, with a shared cache on the side."},{"audioMs":7807,"endMs":11886,"runMs":7807,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":12236,"endMs":16809,"runMs":12236,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":17159,"endMs":20704,"runMs":17159,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the cache?"},{"audioMs":21054,"endMs":27705,"runMs":17159,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto","text":"On the graph, dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":29379,"endMs":33217,"runMs":24784,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 16 steps."},{"audioMs":33567,"endMs":34909,"runMs":24784,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.b","text":"How do you read that one?"},{"audioMs":35259,"endMs":38783,"runMs":24784,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":39833,"endMs":41241,"runMs":24796,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":44520,"endMs":48225,"runMs":44383,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.agentEnd","text":"Agent 0 runs out of steps, never touching the board."},{"audioMs":48575,"endMs":51583,"runMs":44383,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.agentEnd.b","text":"The board was right there, and it never went near it."},{"audioMs":51933,"endMs":58880,"runMs":44383,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent never found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":59230,"endMs":64065,"runMs":44383,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.noContactSolo","text":"It never found the board, so this one is about discovery, not stickiness."},{"audioMs":64415,"endMs":65558,"runMs":44383,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":65908,"endMs":66891,"runMs":44383,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":1}}
